    "detail": "When we arrived from the airport the room was clean and tidy. But there were no towels of any kind. We called the man at the front desk who brought some right up. Only toiletries provided are bar soap and liquid soap. Next day when we got back to the hotel from our day, again, no towels. We called the man at the front desk who again was very helpful. Then we noticed that the head of the shower was broken clean off the hose. It was sitting by itself on the floor of the shower. We called the man at the front desk who didn’t have any replacement hoses so he tried to fix it with tin foil. A very valiant effort but unfortunately didn’t work very well. So thank you to the front desk clerk who tried to fix the issues!",
